  {
   "id": "minimum-path-sum",
   "num": 2,
   "leet_id": 64,
   "title_cn": "最小路径和",
   "title_en": "Minimum Path Sum",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "multi-dp",
   "tags": [
    "数组",
    "动态规划",
    "矩阵"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定一个包含非负整数的 `m × n` 网格 `grid`，请找出一条从左上角到右下角的路径，使路径上的数字总和为**最小**。每次只能向下或向右移动。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "grid = [[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[4,2,1]]",
      "output": "7（1→3→1→1→1）"
     },
     {
      "input": "grid = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]",
      "output": "12"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= m, n <= 200",
     "0 <= grid[i][j] <= 200"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "与 62 同款骨架，把「计数」换成「最短」：`dp[i][j] = min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1]) + grid[i][j]`。",
     "直接把 dp 表叠写在 grid 上（原地），空间 O(1)。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "dp[0][0] = grid[0][0]",
     "首行/首列累加（只有一条路）",
     "内部取上方/左方的较小者 + 当前格",
     "返回 dp[m-1][n-1]"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(mn)",
     "space": "O(1)（原地）"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def minPathSum(self, grid: List[List[int]]) -> int:\n        m, n = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n        for i in range(m):\n            for j in range(n):\n                if i == 0 and j == 0:\n                    continue\n                best = min(grid[i - 1][j] if i else float(\"inf\"),\n                           grid[i][j - 1] if j else float(\"inf\"))\n                grid[i][j] += best\n        return grid[m - 1][n - 1]"
   },
