  {
   "id": "longest-palindromic-substring",
   "num": 3,
   "leet_id": 5,
   "title_cn": "最长回文子串",
   "title_en": "Longest Palindromic Substring",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "multi-dp",
   "tags": [
    "字符串",
    "动态规划"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给你字符串 `s`，返回 `s` 中最长的回文子串。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "s = \"babad\"",
      "output": "\"bab\"（\"aba\" 同样正确）"
     },
     {
      "input": "s = \"cbbd\"",
      "output": "\"bb\""
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= s.length <= 1000",
     "s 仅由数字和英文字母组成"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "**中心扩展**：回文必有中心 —— 每个字符（奇数长）或字符间隙（偶数长）向两侧同步扩张，能扩多远就是多长的回文，共 2n-1 个中心。",
     "区间 DP 也行：`dp[i][j]` = s[i..j] 是否回文，`dp[i][j] = (s[i]==s[j]) && dp[i+1][j-1]`，O(n²)/O(n²)。",
     "进阶 O(n)：Manacher 算法。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "枚举 2n-1 个中心（字符 + 间隙）",
     "从中心向两侧扩张：`s[l] == s[r]` 则 l--, r++",
     "记录最长回文的起止",
     "也可区间 DP 自短向长填表"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n²)",
     "space": "O(1)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def longestPalindrome(self, s: str) -> str:\n        n = len(s)\n        best_l, best_r = 0, 0\n\n        def expand(l, r):                # 返回扩张后的 [l, r]\n            while l >= 0 and r < n and s[l] == s[r]:\n                l -= 1\n                r += 1\n            return l + 1, r - 1\n\n        for c in range(n):\n            for l, r in (expand(c, c), expand(c, c + 1)):  # 奇/偶中心\n                if r - l > best_r - best_l:\n                    best_l, best_r = l, r\n        return s[best_l:best_r + 1]"
   },
